{title: I Surrender All}
{key: B}
{x_theme: holy-spirit, faith-trust, joy, salvation, altar, worship}
{x_source: chrd:i_surrender_all.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
[B]I surrender [E]all, [Gb]I surrender [B]all
[B]All to thee, my [Abm]blessed [E]Savior, [B]I sur[Gb]render [B]all.

{comment: Verse 1}
[B]All to Jesus [Gb]I surrender
[Abm]All to [E]Him I [Gb]freely [B]give
[B]I will ever [Gb]love and trust him,
[Abm]In His [E]presence [Gb]daily [B]live

{comment: Verse 2}
[B]All to Jesus [Gb]I surrender,
[Abm]Humbly [E]at His [Gb]feet I [B]bow,
[B]Worldly pleasures [Gb]all forsaken;
[Abm]Take me, [E]Jesus, [Gb]take me [B]now.

{comment: Verse 3}
[B]All to Jesus [Gb]I surrender,
[Abm]Make me, [E]Savior, [Gb]wholly [B]Thine;
[B]Let me feel Thy [Gb]Holy Spirit,
[Abm]Truly  [E]know that [Gb]Thou art m[B]ine.

{comment: Verse 4}
[B]All to Jesus [Gb]I surrender,
[Abm]Lord, I [E]give [Gb]myself to [B]Thee;
[B]Fill me with Thy [Gb]love and power,
[Abm]Let Thy [E]blessing [Gb]fall on [B]me.

{comment: Verse 5}
[B]All to Jesus [Gb]I surrender,
[Abm]Now I  [E]feel the [Gb]sacred [B]flame.
[B]Oh, the joy of [Gb]full salvation!
[Abm]Glory, [E]glory to [Gb]His   [B]name!
